{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/99c46beb38bc3b4589ceacfc5523af45.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRIO World - Railway is a cozy and creative sandbox experience where you can build your very own train city. Using an easy-to-use building system, you\u2019ll lay tracks, place scenery, and design detailed railway systems that come to life before your eyes. Whether you're a longtime train fan or just looking for a peaceful game to unwind with, this is your perfect escape.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/4dfec5f6434d675a65bb897c3315eca3.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/836da8afea45ae83859d4a55ea89e7f6.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/836da8afea45ae83859d4a55ea89e7f6.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/836da8afea45ae83859d4a55ea89e7f6.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your imagination to life with over 250 beautifully crafted pieces - including tracks, trees, bridges, buildings, animals, and more. All pieces are designed with the classic BRIO wooden toy aesthetic, highlighting the warmth and charm of handcrafted playsets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/603cd2babf08bd6d156649f164131a38.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6485e06d54de069537533d9d4eb10668.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6485e06d54de069537533d9d4eb10668.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6485e06d54de069537533d9d4eb10668.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Meet the charming characters who live in your world and help them with fun little tasks. Complete missions to earn<i>\u00a0Joy\u00a0</i>and unlock new parts and features as you go.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/8cac960f5a9977bbdd200c461be90077.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your trains or cars in an immersive first-person view and see your creations from a whole new perspective, or simply sit back and watch your trains drive along the tracks you\u2019ve laid down. It\u2019s your world - explore it however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>BRIO World - Railway is designed to be a gentle, no-stress experience that welcomes everyone. Whether you want to build for hours, play short creative sessions, or just enjoy watching your trains go by, it\u2019s the perfect way to slow down and enjoy a moment of calm. <br> <br>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428880?t=1754553633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3428880?t=1754553633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/75e46e7eb01249c5849818ad9cfc80f1de7a1a0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754553633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/75e46e7eb01249c5849818ad9cfc80f1de7a1a0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754553633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/99c46beb38bc3b4589ceacfc5523af45.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/2792709b1c5495b3ff9915701400b60c.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BRIO World - Railway is a cozy and creative sandbox experience where you can build your very own train city. Using an easy-to-use building system, you\u2019ll lay tracks, place scenery, and design detailed railway systems that come to life before your eyes. Whether you're a longtime train fan or just looking for a peaceful game to unwind with, this is your perfect escape.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/4dfec5f6434d675a65bb897c3315eca3.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta