ps/3428880/extras/8cac960f5a9977bbdd200c461be90077.webp?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.poster.avif?t=1754553633\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.webm?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/extras/6de3e2001e855c660b6e1d851b168806.mp4?t=1754553633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your trains or cars in an immersive first-person view and see your creations from a whole new perspective, or simply sit back and watch your trains drive along the tracks you\u2019ve laid down. It\u2019s your world - explore it however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>BRIO World - Railway is designed to be a gentle, no-stress experience that welcomes everyone. Whether you want to build for hours, play short creative sessions, or just enjoy watching your trains go by, it\u2019s the perfect way to slow down and enjoy a moment of calm. <br> <br>  </p>","developers":["Filimundus"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428880/cdfaebf634067383ac4787abc86bee89ee58ca84/header.jpg?t=1754553633","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br